1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,309
Ayodhya ki zameen ke sabse neeche, ek mutthi koyla mila.

2
00:00:04,309 --> 00:00:07,757
Us koyle ne ek tareekh batayi, 910 BCE.

3
00:00:07,757 --> 00:00:12,497
Yaani Isa se 910 saal pehle bhi, yahaan log rehte the,

4
00:00:12,497 --> 00:00:16,375
chulha jalate the. Yeh kisi kahani ki baat nahi,

5
00:00:16,375 --> 00:00:18,530
yeh lab ki report hai.

6
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:22,409
Yeh report Archaeological Survey of India ki hai, yaani ASI.

7
00:00:22,409 --> 00:00:24,736
ASI desh ki sarkari sanstha hai,

8
00:00:24,736 --> 00:00:28,226
jo purani jagahon ki khudai aur dekhbhaal karti hai.

9
00:00:28,226 --> 00:00:31,329
Lekin us report mein sirf koyla nahi tha.

10
00:00:31,329 --> 00:00:34,820
Kuch baaton par aaj tak vidwan bahas karte hain.

11
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,150
Zameen ke neeche ek badi imarat ki neev bhi mili.

12
00:00:38,150 --> 00:00:41,479
Kuch ne kaha, yeh khambon wala ek vishal bhawan tha.

13
00:00:41,479 --> 00:00:42,478
Kuch ne kaha,

14
00:00:42,478 --> 00:00:45,475
yeh alag alag zamane ke farsh ke tukde hain.

15
00:00:45,475 --> 00:00:47,472
Dono taraf padhe likhe log hain,

16
00:00:47,472 --> 00:00:49,470
aur dono ke paas daleel hai.

17
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:52,919
Sabut ke saath chalte hain, aur shuruaat karte hain granthon se.

18
00:00:52,919 --> 00:00:56,369
Pehle dekhte hain ki purane granth Ayodhya ko kaise dikhate hain.

19
00:00:56,369 --> 00:00:58,877
Kyunki khudai ka matlab tabhi samajh aata hai.

20
00:00:58,877 --> 00:01:02,640
Jab pata ho ki log zameen ke neeche dhoondh kya rahe the.

21
00:01:02,640 --> 00:01:05,589
Valmiki Ramayana ka pehla hissa hai Balakanda.

22
00:01:05,589 --> 00:01:10,224
Usme Ayodhya ek kile wali rajdhani hai, Saryu nadi ke kinare.

23
00:01:10,224 --> 00:01:14,437
Majboot deewaron se ghiri hui, ek surakshit aur sundar nagar.

24
00:01:14,437 --> 00:01:18,650
Ramayana ke mutabik, is nagar ko Manu ne basaya tha.

25
00:01:18,650 --> 00:01:19,881
Aur uska aakaar?

26
00:01:19,881 --> 00:01:23,576
Balakanda ke hisaab se Ayodhya 12 yojana lambi thi.

27
00:01:23,576 --> 00:01:27,270
Yojana yaani purane zamane mein doori naapne ki ikai.

28
00:01:27,270 --> 00:01:31,785
Aaj ke kilometre mein iska hisaab vidwan alag alag lagate hain.

29
00:01:31,785 --> 00:01:36,300
Par sandesh saaf hai, yeh ek vishal nagar ki tasveer hai.

30
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:40,263
Phir aata hai Skanda Purana, jiska ek hissa hai Ayodhya Mahatmya.

31
00:01:40,263 --> 00:01:44,585
Mahatmya yaani kisi teerth ki mahima aur uska naksha batane wala granth.

32
00:01:44,585 --> 00:01:48,188
Isme Ayodhya ki pavitra jagahon ka poora bhugol likha hai.

33
00:01:48,188 --> 00:01:52,150
Kaun sa sthaan kahaan hai, kaun sa ashram kis disha mein.

34
00:01:52,150 --> 00:01:56,473
Isi granth mein Janmasthan ki jagah bhi dishaon se batayi gayi hai.

35
00:01:56,473 --> 00:02:00,435
Woh Vighneshwar ke poorab mein hai, aur Vashishtha ke uttar mein.

36
00:02:00,435 --> 00:02:03,677
Saath hi Lomash rishi ke ashram ke pashchim mein.

37
00:02:03,677 --> 00:02:06,919
Yaani granth ek tarah ka purana naksha deta hai,

38
00:02:06,919 --> 00:02:08,360
bina kisi map ke.

39
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:12,218
Granthon ke alawa, logon ki zubaani kahaniyan bhi hain.

40
00:02:12,218 --> 00:02:16,933
Faizabad ke purane District Gazetteer mein aisi ek kahani darj hai.

41
00:02:16,933 --> 00:02:19,077
Gazetteer yaani ek sarkari kitaab,

42
00:02:19,077 --> 00:02:22,935
jisme kisi zile ka itihaas aur haal likha jaata.

43
00:02:22,935 --> 00:02:27,650
Kahani kehti hai, Raja Vikramaditya ne Ayodhya ko dobara basaya tha.

44
00:02:27,650 --> 00:02:31,833
Aur unhone ek shaandaar mandir banwaya, 84 khambon par khada.

45
00:02:31,833 --> 00:02:36,017
Khambe kaale patthar ke the, jise log kasauti kehte the.

46
00:02:36,017 --> 00:02:38,108
Dhyaan dijiye, yeh legend hai,

47
00:02:38,108 --> 00:02:41,037
kisi granth ya khudai ka sabut nahi.

48
00:02:41,037 --> 00:02:45,220
Par aisi kahaniyon ne logon ki jigyasa hamesha zinda rakhi.

49
00:02:45,220 --> 00:02:50,443
Ab kahani granthon se nikal kar mitti mein utarti hai.

50
00:02:50,443 --> 00:02:56,188
Saal 2003, aur Ayodhya mein shuru hoti hai ek badi khudai.

51
00:02:56,188 --> 00:03:01,934
Is khudai par bahut logon ki nazar thi. Chaliye dekhte hain,

52
00:03:01,934 --> 00:03:05,590
ASI ne kya kiya, aur kaise kiya.

53
00:03:05,590 --> 00:03:09,649
March se August tak, ASI ki team ne yahaan kaam kiya.

54
00:03:09,649 --> 00:03:12,970
Yeh khudai apni marzi se nahi ho rahi thi.

55
00:03:12,970 --> 00:03:17,030
Allahabad High Court ki Lucknow bench ne iska aadesh diya tha.

56
00:03:17,030 --> 00:03:20,720
Isliye har kadam dhyaan se, likh kar, uthaya jaana tha.

57
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:24,064
Khudai se pehle ek aur jaanch hui thi,

58
00:03:24,064 --> 00:03:28,662
Ground Penetrating Radar survey. Yaani zameen ke andar radar bhej kar,

59
00:03:28,662 --> 00:03:31,588
bina khode, chhupi cheezon ki tasveer lena.

60
00:03:31,588 --> 00:03:36,186
Radar ne kuch jagah ajeeb nishaan dikhaye, jinhe anomaly kehte hain.

61
00:03:36,186 --> 00:03:39,530
ASI ko inhi nishaanon ki sachchai jaanchni thi.

62
00:03:39,530 --> 00:03:42,468
Iske liye ASI ne 82 trench khode.

63
00:03:42,468 --> 00:03:44,987
Trench yaani khudai ka chaukor gaddha,

64
00:03:44,987 --> 00:03:48,345
jisme mitti parat dar parat hatai jaati hai.

65
00:03:48,345 --> 00:03:52,542
Har trench ek khidki jaisi thi, ateet mein jhaankne ki.

66
00:03:52,542 --> 00:03:55,900
Aur har khidki ne kuch na kuch dikhaya.

67
00:03:55,900 --> 00:03:59,598
Khudai mein mitti ki parten sabse zaroori sabut hoti hain.

68
00:03:59,598 --> 00:04:00,707
Parat yaani stratum,

69
00:04:00,707 --> 00:04:04,405
mitti ki woh tah jo ek zamane mein jamti hai.

70
00:04:04,405 --> 00:04:07,363
Sabse neeche sabse purani parat, aur upar nayi.

71
00:04:07,363 --> 00:04:11,430
Jaise ek ke upar ek rakhe akhbaar, neeche wala sabse purana.

72
00:04:11,430 --> 00:04:13,882
Team mein archaeologist the, mazdoor the,

73
00:04:13,882 --> 00:04:18,376
aur nigraani karne wale adhikari bhi. Mitti ki tokriyan chhaani jaati,

74
00:04:18,376 --> 00:04:22,462
aur nikle tukde alag rakhe jaate. Har cheez ki photo,

75
00:04:22,462 --> 00:04:24,505
naksha aur gehrai darj hoti.

76
00:04:24,505 --> 00:04:29,000
Kyunki is khudai ka har panna baad mein jaancha jaana tha.

77
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:32,715
Ab aate hain asli sawaal par, mitti ne kya bataya.

78
00:04:32,715 --> 00:04:35,688
Shuruaat sabse neeche wali parat se karte hain.

79
00:04:35,688 --> 00:04:39,775
Kyunki wahi batati hai ki yahaan insaan sabse pehle kab aaye.

80
00:04:39,775 --> 00:04:43,490
Khudai ki kahani hamesha neeche se upar padhi jaati hai.

81
00:04:43,490 --> 00:04:47,603
ASI ne sabse purani parat ko naam diya, Period I.

82
00:04:47,603 --> 00:04:51,716
Is parat mein mile khaas bartan, Northern Black Polished Ware.

83
00:04:51,716 --> 00:04:53,772
Yaani kaale, chamakdaar, patle bartan,

84
00:04:53,772 --> 00:04:57,885
jo prachin Bharat ke shehron ki pehchaan maane jaate hain.

85
00:04:57,885 --> 00:05:02,820
ASI ke mutabik yahi log is jagah ke pehle basne wale the.

86
00:05:02,820 --> 00:05:05,773
Isi parat se mitti ki murtiyan bhi mili,

87
00:05:05,773 --> 00:05:07,249
jinhe terracotta kehte hain.

88
00:05:07,249 --> 00:05:10,202
Yaani pakaayi hui mitti se bani chhoti aakritiyan.

89
00:05:10,202 --> 00:05:12,417
Saath mein kaanch ke manke mile,

90
00:05:12,417 --> 00:05:15,001
jo shaayad gehne mein pirote jaate the.

91
00:05:15,001 --> 00:05:18,323
Har cheez batati hai ki yahaan ek basti thi,

92
00:05:18,323 --> 00:05:19,430
sirf padaav nahi.

93
00:05:19,430 --> 00:05:24,094
Aur phir mili ek gol mohar, jis par kuch likha tha.

94
00:05:24,094 --> 00:05:26,215
Likhawat thi Ashokan Brahmi mein.

95
00:05:26,215 --> 00:05:32,151
Brahmi yaani Bharat ki sabse purani padhi ja sakne wali lipiyon mein se ek.

96
00:05:32,151 --> 00:05:36,392
Wahi lipi jo Samrat Ashok ke shilalekhon par milti hai.

97
00:05:36,392 --> 00:05:39,360
Ek chhoti si mohar, par bada sawaal,

98
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:41,480
isse kisne istemaal kiya hoga?

99
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:45,754
Ab us koyle ki baat, jisse humne video shuru kiya tha.

100
00:05:45,754 --> 00:05:49,639
Period I ki parat se koyle ke tukde nikale gaye.

101
00:05:49,639 --> 00:05:51,582
Phir unki radiocarbon dating hui.

102
00:05:51,582 --> 00:05:54,302
Radiocarbon dating yaani vigyan se yeh hisaab,

103
00:05:54,302 --> 00:05:57,022
ki koi jaivik cheez kitni purani hai.

104
00:05:57,022 --> 00:06:00,130
Jaivik yaani jo kabhi zinda thi, jaise lakdi.

105
00:06:00,130 --> 00:06:02,420
Nateeja aaya, 910 BCE ke aaspaas.

106
00:06:02,420 --> 00:06:05,854
Ek doosra namoona bhi isi daur ke kareeb nikla.

107
00:06:05,854 --> 00:06:09,289
Matlab bahut purane zamane mein, Ashok se bhi pehle,

108
00:06:09,289 --> 00:06:10,816
yahaan log rehte the.

109
00:06:10,816 --> 00:06:13,869
Report khud maanti hai ki aisi tareekhon mein,

110
00:06:13,869 --> 00:06:16,540
kuch upar neeche ki gunjaish rehti hai.

111
00:06:16,540 --> 00:06:20,613
Ab upar ki parton ki taraf chalte hain, madhyakaal mein.

112
00:06:20,613 --> 00:06:24,685
Madhyakaal yaani prachin aur aadhunik ke beech ka lamba daur.

113
00:06:24,685 --> 00:06:27,128
Yahaan ASI ko kuch aisa mila,

114
00:06:27,128 --> 00:06:29,572
jisne sabse zyada charcha bator li.

115
00:06:29,572 --> 00:06:32,830
Zameen ke neeche ek badi imarat ke nishaan.

116
00:06:32,830 --> 00:06:36,867
ASI ke mutabik yeh imarat lagbhag 50 metre lambi thi.

117
00:06:36,867 --> 00:06:39,289
Uski disha thi uttar se dakshin.

118
00:06:39,289 --> 00:06:42,519
Report ne ise shuruaati madhyakaal ka bataya. Matlab,

119
00:06:42,519 --> 00:06:46,960
kisi bahut bade dhaanche ki neev, jo kabhi yahaan khada tha.

120
00:06:46,960 --> 00:06:51,897
Report mein is imarat se jude kai khambon ke aadhar bhi darj hue.

121
00:06:51,897 --> 00:06:56,075
Khambe ka aadhar yaani woh chabootra, jis par khamba tikta hai.

122
00:06:56,075 --> 00:06:57,594
ASI ka kehna tha,

123
00:06:57,594 --> 00:07:01,012
yeh aadhar ek bade khambon wale hall ke the.

124
00:07:01,012 --> 00:07:04,810
Yaani kabhi yahaan khambon par tika ek vishal bhawan tha.

125
00:07:04,810 --> 00:07:08,746
Yahin se kahani seedhi nahi rehti. ASI ki report aayi,

126
00:07:08,746 --> 00:07:11,107
aur uske saath sawaal bhi aaye.

127
00:07:11,107 --> 00:07:14,649
Kuch swatantra archaeologists ne report ko dhyaan se padha.

128
00:07:14,649 --> 00:07:18,585
Swatantra yaani jo is khudai ki team mein nahi the.

129
00:07:18,585 --> 00:07:21,340
Aur unhone ek alag tasveer saamne rakhi.

130
00:07:21,340 --> 00:07:24,402
Unka kehna tha, jinhe khambon ke aadhar kaha gaya,

131
00:07:24,402 --> 00:07:26,443
woh asal mein kuch aur hain.

132
00:07:26,443 --> 00:07:29,845
Unke hisaab se yeh eenton ke farsh ke tukde the.

133
00:07:29,845 --> 00:07:32,567
Aur yeh tukde ek hi zamane ke nahi,

134
00:07:32,567 --> 00:07:35,969
alag alag daur ke the. Yaani alag samay ki parten,

135
00:07:35,969 --> 00:07:37,670
ek saath dikh rahi thi.

136
00:07:37,670 --> 00:07:39,635
Is daleel ka matlab bada hai.

137
00:07:39,635 --> 00:07:41,928
Agar aadhar alag alag daur ke hain,

138
00:07:41,928 --> 00:07:44,548
toh woh ek hall ke nahi ho sakte.

139
00:07:44,548 --> 00:07:46,840
Phir woh bojh uthane wale khambe nahi,

140
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:48,478
bas farsh ke hisse hain.

141
00:07:48,478 --> 00:07:52,080
Is nazariye mein ek vishal khambon wala bhawan saabit nahi hota.

142
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:54,947
Doosri taraf ASI apni report par kayam rahi.

143
00:07:54,947 --> 00:07:58,890
Uske hisaab se neev ki lambai, disha aur bacha hua dhaancha,

144
00:07:58,890 --> 00:08:01,757
ek bade nirmaan ki taraf ishaara karte hain.

145
00:08:01,757 --> 00:08:03,549
Dono taraf trained archaeologists hain.

146
00:08:03,549 --> 00:08:07,850
Aur dono ek hi mitti ko alag nazar se padh rahe hain.

147
00:08:07,850 --> 00:08:11,058
Puratatva mein aisa aksar hota hai.

148
00:08:11,058 --> 00:08:16,940
Puratatva yaani mitti mein dabe sabuton se ateet padhne ka vigyan.

149
00:08:16,940 --> 00:08:21,217
Mitti khud nahi bolti, use padhna padta hai.

150
00:08:21,217 --> 00:08:26,029
Ek eent ka tukda kisi ke liye aadhar hai,

151
00:08:26,029 --> 00:08:30,841
kisi ke liye farsh. Isiliye report ke baad bhi,

152
00:08:30,841 --> 00:08:32,980
bahas khatam nahi hoti.

153
00:08:32,980 --> 00:08:36,456
Ab woh hissa, jo aksar khabron mein chhoot jaata hai.

154
00:08:36,456 --> 00:08:39,931
Woh sawaal, jiska jawab khudai ke paas bhi saaf nahi.

155
00:08:39,931 --> 00:08:43,407
Imaandaar kahani mein, 'pata nahi' bhi ek jawab hota hai.

156
00:08:43,407 --> 00:08:47,230
Aur sabut ke saath chalne ka matlab, use bhi seedha kehna.

157
00:08:47,230 --> 00:08:50,165
Maan lijiye wahaan ek badi madhyakaaleen imarat thi.

158
00:08:50,165 --> 00:08:53,100
Toh sawaal uthta hai, woh khatam kaise hui?

159
00:08:53,100 --> 00:08:56,403
Kya samay ke saath woh dheere dheere khandahar bani?

160
00:08:56,403 --> 00:08:58,971
Ya use jaan boojh kar giraaya gaya?

161
00:08:58,971 --> 00:09:02,640
Khudai ke sabut is sawaal ko saaf hal nahi karte.

162
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:05,694
Us imarat aur baad ke nirmaan ke beech,

163
00:09:05,694 --> 00:09:09,511
kai sadiyon ka faasla hai. Itne lambe samay mein baarish,

164
00:09:09,511 --> 00:09:12,564
baadh aur waqt, sab apna kaam karte hain.

165
00:09:12,564 --> 00:09:15,618
Mitti mein girne ki tareekh likhi nahi hoti.

166
00:09:15,618 --> 00:09:18,290
Isiliye yeh sawaal aaj bhi khula hai.

167
00:09:18,290 --> 00:09:22,253
Aur bhi sawaal baaki hain. Sabse purani basti kitni badi thi?

168
00:09:22,253 --> 00:09:25,495
Mohar kiski thi, aur uska maalik kya karta tha?

169
00:09:25,495 --> 00:09:29,097
Granthon ki Ayodhya aur mitti ki Ayodhya, kahaan milti hain,

170
00:09:29,097 --> 00:09:29,818
kahaan alag?

171
00:09:29,818 --> 00:09:33,420
In par aage ki research hi roshni daal sakti hai.

172
00:09:33,420 --> 00:09:37,190
Aaj aap Ayodhya jaayein, toh shuruaat Saryu ke ghaat se kijiye.

173
00:09:37,190 --> 00:09:39,588
Wahi nadi jiska zikr Balakanda mein hai.

174
00:09:39,588 --> 00:09:43,015
Shaam ki aarti mein ghaat diyon se bhar jaate hain.

175
00:09:43,015 --> 00:09:45,414
Granth ki nadi aur aaj ki nadi,

176
00:09:45,414 --> 00:09:47,470
ek hi naam se behti hai.

177
00:09:47,470 --> 00:09:51,417
Purane shehar ki galiyon mein ghoomiye, mandir aur ghaat dekhiye.

178
00:09:51,417 --> 00:09:55,758
Jahaan khudai hui thi, woh jagah aaj pooja ka sthaan hai.

179
00:09:55,758 --> 00:09:57,731
Roz shraddhalu wahaan aate hain.

180
00:09:57,731 --> 00:10:00,493
Aur jo sabut khud padhna chahte hain,

181
00:10:00,493 --> 00:10:04,440
woh ASI ki website asi.nic.in se shuruaat kar sakte hain.

182
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:08,465
Agar aap kisi museum mein kaale chamakdaar NBPW bartan dekhein,

183
00:10:08,465 --> 00:10:10,880
toh rukiye. Unhe dhyaan se dekhiye.

184
00:10:10,880 --> 00:10:15,710
Yahi woh bartan hain jo Ayodhya ki sabse purani parat mein mile.

185
00:10:15,710 --> 00:10:18,930
Ek chhota sa tukda, aur bahut lambi kahani.

186
00:10:18,930 --> 00:10:21,698
Toh hisaab kya bana? Granth ek vishal,

187
00:10:21,698 --> 00:10:23,674
kile wali Ayodhya dikhate hain.

188
00:10:23,674 --> 00:10:27,628
Mitti batati hai ki yahaan bahut pehle log base the,

189
00:10:27,628 --> 00:10:30,000
aur bartan, manke, mohar chhod gaye.

190
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:32,372
Beech ki ek badi imarat par,

191
00:10:32,372 --> 00:10:35,140
vidwan aaj bhi do raay rakhte hain.

192
00:10:35,140 --> 00:10:37,810
Aur sabse bada sawaal yeh hai.

193
00:10:37,810 --> 00:10:42,705
Kya granth aur mitti kabhi poori tarah ek hi kahani sunayenge?

194
00:10:42,705 --> 00:10:47,600
Shaayad naye tareeke, nayi research, kuch aur parten kholein. Tab tak,

195
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:52,050
jo pakka hai use pakka kahiye, aur jo khula hai,

196
00:10:52,050 --> 00:10:53,830
use khula rehne dijiye.

197
00:10:53,830 --> 00:10:57,509
Agli baar hum chalenge samundar ki taraf, Dwarka.

198
00:10:57,509 --> 00:11:02,109
Kehte hain Krishna ki nagari paani mein sama gayi thi.

199
00:11:02,109 --> 00:11:06,708
Wahaan gotakhoron ne kya dekha, aur vigyan kya kehta hai?

200
00:11:06,708 --> 00:11:09,468
